WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:13,340
Shuangyue, I will become stronger with the Snow Witch

2
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,740
Find father and mother, find you

3
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,140
Reunited our family

4
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:27,060
I face such dangerous things alone

5
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:31,910
She doesn't want to be the Ling Lord. She should be a hunting tiger next to us.

6
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:34,200
What can we do?

7
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,590
The time when we picked her up

8
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:39,990
You should have thought that sooner or later you would panic

9
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:46,350
She will definitely have great achievements in the future

10
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,350
We can't tie her around

11
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,550
We raised her with great difficulty

12
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:52,150
She is about to leave

13
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:53,150
You are so willing

14
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:57,680
How could I be willing to give up?

15
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:03,560
She is also my son

16
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,560
Dad and Mom, what are you doing?

17
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:07,360
I just go to Chixiao Sect to practice

18
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:09,960
It’s not like I won’t come back

19
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,760
Even if you go to all over the world

20
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,360
You are still my parents

21
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,760
I am your son too

22
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,390
so believe me

23
00:01:16,390 --> 00:01:32,000
I'll come back to you when I'm done

24
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:39,610
The road ahead is for us to walk together

25
00:01:39,610 --> 00:01:41,840
This was put together by everyone in the village

26
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:44,240
Each of the three of you has one hundred coins.

27
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,040
Save some flowers outside

28
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:49,720
Mom and dad, you and mom are both older.

29
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:52,460
You should keep this money.

30
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:54,240
What words

31
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,840
Your father and I are both under forty.

32
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,440
Now you, Liu Zhe Shen Shen Gang, are taking advantage of

33
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,840
Besides, you guys are out and about.

34
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:02,040
It is inevitable that there will be times when it is necessary to take care of things up and down.

35
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,840
What can I do without money?

36
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,040
She's fine

37
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,040
Dad, Yaoyao Qingyu and I left

38
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,440
You should also take care of yourselves at home

39
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:11,840
Son, when you go out, do everything according to your ability.

40
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,940
If you can't survive

41
00:02:12,940 --> 00:02:14,840
Your parents will always welcome you home

42
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,240
Your mother and I think

43
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,640
As long as you and Yaoyao can be happy

44
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:23,030
Remember, Chujiacun will always be your home

45
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:25,980
Dad, Mom, take care of yourself
